  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Welcome, Scientist!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "This is a **check-in**, not a test. Scientists are curious and not afraid to guess. Show us what you know and where you are curious to learn more."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "emoji": "🧪",
      "alt": "Science time!",
      "caption": "Science time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 1: Solids, liquids and gases"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "Matter comes in three main states. A **solid** keeps its shape. A **liquid** flows and takes the shape of its container. A **gas** spreads out to fill all the space. Heating can **melt** a solid or **boil** a liquid; cooling can **freeze** it or make a gas **condense**."
    },
    {
      "type": "explainer",
      "title": "Three states of water",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "caption": "Ice is a solid. It keeps its shape.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "🧊",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w",
              "size": 3,
              "label": "solid"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "When it melts it becomes a liquid. A liquid flows and takes the shape of its container.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "💧",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w",
              "size": 3,
              "label": "liquid",
              "anim": "float"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "When it boils it becomes a gas called water vapour. A gas spreads out to fill the space.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "♨️",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 40,
              "id": "w",
              "size": 3,
              "label": "gas",
              "anim": "float"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "question": {
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "What do we call ice turning into water?",
