    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 3: Food chains"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "Every food chain starts with a **producer**, a plant that makes its own food using sunlight. Animals that eat plants are **herbivores**; animals that eat other animals are **carnivores**. Grass, then rabbit, then fox is a food chain."
    },
