    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 4: Forces and magnets"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "Forces can speed things up, slow them down or change their shape. **Friction** slows things that rub together. **Gravity** pulls things toward the Earth. A **magnet** pulls some metals, like iron, but not wood or plastic."
    },
